SUMMARY: S.H.I.F.T. Outreach Program
DESCRIPTION:S.H.I.F.T’s Outreach Program is focused on preventing homeles
 sness\, serving those living with low income throughout South Simcoe.\n\n
 The program's goal is to connect individuals\, couples\, and families to 
 urgently needed supplies\, services\, and supports as well as provide eme
 rgency assistance to those at risk of or experiencing homelessness and/or
  food insecurity (housed or otherwise).\n\nFor more information\, call or
  text: 705-890-8173 email: outreach@shiftforgood.ca mailto:outreach@shift
 forgood.ca mailto:outreach@shiftforgood.ca
CATEGORIES:All-Ages,Drop-in,SocialSupport
