SUMMARY: Mermaid Story Time with Mermaid Serenity
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun and fantastical mermaid storytime featuring
  Mermaid Serenity! In addition to storytime\, children will have an oppor
 tunity to take photos on the giant inflatable shell throne\, enjoy some m
 ermaid themed colouring\, and check out our interactive floor map on loan
  from Ocean Week Canada https://oceanweekcan.ca/ .\n\nRegistration is req
 uired for all attendees: kids and parents. Register on Eventbrite https:/
 /www.eventbrite.ca/e/mermaid-storytime-with-mermaid-serenity-tickets-1989
 232807877?aff=oddtdtcreator to attend.\n\nMermaid Serenity loves to bring
  joy\, education and music to everyone she meets. Sitting on a giant shel
 l\, she reads stories about the magical underwater worlds on our planet\,
  teaches about mermaid folklore\, sings enchanting songs and plays her be
 autiful pan drum. After story time you can sit for a photo with Serenity 
 on her shell and pose with a mermaid crown to capture the magic forever.\
 n\nFor children aged 2-5
CATEGORIES:Children,Registered
